WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:04.960
Hi, Mystery Recapped here. Today, I’m&nbsp;
going to explain an American dystopian&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:04.960 --> 00:00:09.600
action horror film called “The Purge.”&nbsp;
Spoilers ahead! Watch out and take care!
&nbsp;

00:00:13.840 --> 00:00:17.200
At the beginning of the movie, we see&nbsp;
several clips of people killing and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:17.200 --> 00:00:21.520
assaulting each other, and houses being&nbsp;
burned. Several shootouts and gang fights&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:21.520 --> 00:00:27.360
resulting in hundreds of deaths are seen. 
In 2014, the Republican and Democratic parties had&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:27.360 --> 00:00:32.720
collapsed in the US. An economic crisis gave rise&nbsp;
to a third political party called the New Founding&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:32.720 --> 00:00:38.880
Fathers Of America (NFFA). The party leader is&nbsp;
the U.S. president, Bracken. He and the others&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:38.880 --> 00:00:44.080
from his party formulated an extreme law called&nbsp;
“The Purge”. Every once in a year, one night,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:44.080 --> 00:00:48.720
for twelve hours straight, all crimes are legal&nbsp;
and no emergency services will be available.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:49.280 --> 00:00:54.000
People are allowed to release their inhibitions&nbsp;
in any way they choose, including murder. It is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:59.760
now the year 2022. Because of the purge, the&nbsp;
United States has become virtually crime-free,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:59.760 --> 00:01:05.600
and unemployment rates have dropped to 1%. 
It is the day of the Purge. James Sandin drives&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:05.600 --> 00:01:10.240
back to his home in a wealthy gated community to&nbsp;
be safe during the night. He sees his neighbours&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:10.240 --> 00:01:14.160
place blue flowers in their front yard, to&nbsp;
show their support to the purging system.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:14.720 --> 00:01:18.400
James too has a blue flower, suggesting&nbsp;
that he is a supporter of the Purge.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:19.040 --> 00:01:22.960
James is planning to spend the night locked&nbsp;
in with his wife Mary and their children,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:22.960 --> 00:01:26.560
Zoey and Charlie. Zoey is in her&nbsp;
room with her boyfriend Henry. 
&nbsp;

00:01:27.280 --> 00:01:30.800
James is not fond of their relationship,&nbsp;
so Henry sneaks out of the house.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:31.360 --> 00:01:35.360
As Henry sneaks out, the two see a&nbsp;
neighbor sharpening a weapon for tonight.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:35.360 --> 00:01:40.240
As Mary places the flowers in their yard, their&nbsp;
obnoxious neighbour, Grace Ferrin, approaches her&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:40.240 --> 00:01:45.120
with some cookies. The two talk about the lockdown&nbsp;
happening in an hour, and go their separate ways.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:45.760 --> 00:01:50.400
James’s son, Charlie, is then seen playing&nbsp;
with his creepy robotic toy, Timmy. 
&nbsp;

00:01:51.280 --> 00:01:55.200
Later that evening, the family happily has&nbsp;
dinner together and goes to their study room&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:55.200 --> 00:02:00.240
to prepare for the purge. First, James turns on&nbsp;
the surveillance camera placed around the house.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:00.880 --> 00:02:05.120
Then, he turns on the security system&nbsp;
which brings down metal doors and windows,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:05.120 --> 00:02:09.920
closing every possible opening in the house.&nbsp;
Lastly, he brings out a gun from the safe for&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:09.920 --> 00:02:14.560
protection. Then the family sits down to watch&nbsp;
the official initiation of the purge on TV.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:15.200 --> 00:02:20.240
It is announced that the Purge is fully in motion.&nbsp;
Weapons of class four or lower are now legal.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:20.800 --> 00:02:25.600
However, all other weapons are restricted.&nbsp;
Government officials of ranking ten or above&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:25.600 --> 00:02:30.880
are immune to the Purge, so an attack on them is&nbsp;
still considered illegal. After a siren blares,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:30.880 --> 00:02:34.720
any and all crimes including murder will&nbsp;
be legal for twelve continuous hours.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:35.280 --> 00:02:40.320
Police, fire, and any other emergency&nbsp;
medical services will be unavailable. As the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:40.320 --> 00:02:44.960
broadcast completes, the siren starts to blare,&nbsp;
indicating that the purge has now started. 
&nbsp;

00:02:45.760 --> 00:02:50.720
James tells his kids that since they can afford&nbsp;
protection, they will be fine. Zoey then goes&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:50.720 --> 00:02:55.760
back to her room. Charlie, on the other hand,&nbsp;
doesn't seem to like the idea of the purge,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:55.760 --> 00:02:59.680
but James tries to make him understand,&nbsp;
saying that it allows people to take out their&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:59.680 --> 00:03:05.520
frustration. He too then goes to his room.
Zoey hears a thud in her room and finds Henry,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:05.520 --> 00:03:10.160
who had snuck in before the security system&nbsp;
was engaged. Henry tells Zoey that he wants&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:10.160 --> 00:03:14.640
to talk to her father about their relationship.&nbsp;
Since James cannot throw him out of the house&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:14.640 --> 00:03:18.160
during this time, he thinks it's the perfect&nbsp;
time for him to convince her father. 
&nbsp;

00:03:18.960 --> 00:03:23.040
Everyone in the house relaxes, while&nbsp;
Charlie plays with his robot Timmy.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:23.040 --> 00:03:26.560
He moves Timmy around the house, surveilling&nbsp;
everything through Timmy’s camera.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:27.280 --> 00:03:30.800
He sends Timmy to the study room and&nbsp;
watches the surveillance footage.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:30.800 --> 00:03:34.480
He sees a man running away from someone,&nbsp;
and stand right in front of their house. 
&nbsp;

00:03:35.280 --> 00:03:38.960
Charlie runs to watch the surveillance&nbsp;
footage from near, and sees a man begging&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:38.960 --> 00:03:43.280
for help outside their house. In order to&nbsp;
help him, Charlie disarms the metal door. 
&nbsp;

00:03:44.080 --> 00:03:47.600
At the same time, Henry makes his way&nbsp;
towards James' room to talk to him. 
&nbsp;

00:03:48.400 --> 00:03:52.880
Realising that Charlie has disarmed the metal&nbsp;
door, James runs to the study room and quickly&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:52.880 --> 00:03:59.760
puts the metal doors down again. However, the man&nbsp;
gets in. James, Mary, Charlie, and the man are in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:59.760 --> 00:04:04.720
the room when suddenly, Henry fires at James&nbsp;
from the stairs. He wants to kill James so he&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:04.720 --> 00:04:10.400
can be with Zoey. The two fire at each other and&nbsp;
Henry gets shot. Seeing this, Zoey saves Henry and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:10.400 --> 00:04:14.400
takes him away, after which James looks around&nbsp;
to see that the strange man is gone too. 
&nbsp;

00:04:15.120 --> 00:04:20.400
To ensure his family's safety, James takes his&nbsp;
family into a safe room and goes to look for Zoey.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:20.400 --> 00:04:25.200
He finds Henry’s dead body in the room. We see&nbsp;
that the stranger is standing right behind him&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:25.200 --> 00:04:30.320
as he checks Henry’s pulse, but James doesn’t see&nbsp;
him. Charlie sees a group of people approaching&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:30.320 --> 00:04:34.480
their home through the camera and calls his&nbsp;
parents. The group is masked and has weapons&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:34.480 --> 00:04:38.720
in their hands. The group leader stands right&nbsp;
in front of the camera and starts talking.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:39.280 --> 00:04:42.800
He knows James’s name and tells the&nbsp;
family that one of their targets was lost.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:43.360 --> 00:04:46.480
The group got to know from their neighbour&nbsp;
that the target had run into their house.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:47.120 --> 00:04:52.000
Now, the group wants the target out, so that they&nbsp;
can kill him. If the family doesn’t send him out&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:52.000 --> 00:04:56.480
in time, they threaten to get inside the house&nbsp;
and kill everyone, as they know a way to break in.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:57.040 --> 00:05:00.960
Then, the group cuts off the power supply&nbsp;
to the house, and everything goes black. 
&nbsp;

00:05:01.840 --> 00:05:06.080
James tells the family that they have to find&nbsp;
the man and force him outside, but Charlie is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:06.080 --> 00:05:10.960
reluctant to the idea. James and Mary go out to&nbsp;
search for him. Charlie too looks for him with&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:10.960 --> 00:05:16.000
the help of Timmy, and finds him hiding behind the&nbsp;
sofa in the living room. He blinks Timmy’s light&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:16.000 --> 00:05:20.880
at the man and makes him follow it; Charlie is&nbsp;
trying to help the man. He takes him to his room,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:20.880 --> 00:05:24.800
where he has formed hiding in the closet.&nbsp;
Timmy flashes his light at the hiding,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:24.800 --> 00:05:28.800
and the man sees it. He finally goes&nbsp;
inside it, after thanking Timmy. 
&nbsp;

00:05:29.520 --> 00:05:34.400
Just then, the Purger's leader calls James to&nbsp;
the front door. The two talk through an opening,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:34.400 --> 00:05:39.040
and James explains to him that they are not trying&nbsp;
to save the stranger. The leader then shoots one&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:39.040 --> 00:05:43.040
of his own men to threaten James, while claiming&nbsp;
that the group’s equipment to break the door is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:43.040 --> 00:05:48.400
arriving soon. James, fearing his family’s&nbsp;
safety, gets back to look for the stranger.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:48.400 --> 00:05:51.840
He goes into Charlie’s room and sees the&nbsp;
stranger holding Zoey at gunpoint. 
&nbsp;

00:05:52.640 --> 00:05:57.280
As he threatens James, Mary comes behind&nbsp;
him. James and the man get into a fight&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:57.280 --> 00:06:02.320
and James accidentally shoots him. He and&nbsp;
Mary then tie the man to a chair. However,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:02.320 --> 00:06:07.760
the man starts to fight back. James makes Mary&nbsp;
pick on the stranger’s wound so he would give up.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:07.760 --> 00:06:11.680
Charlie watches all of this in horror.&nbsp;
They prepare to give him to the gang,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:11.680 --> 00:06:14.000
but realize that they would not&nbsp;
be any better if they did.
&nbsp;

00:06:14.720 --> 00:06:18.560
The stranger too offers James that he will&nbsp;
go outside so that he can save his family.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:19.120 --> 00:06:23.360
James realizes how wrong they are, and tells&nbsp;
Mary that they will have to fight back and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:23.360 --> 00:06:27.920
defend themselves. Just then, the purger’s&nbsp;
equipment to open the doors and windows arrive.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:28.480 --> 00:06:33.760
They attach huge chains to the doors and pull on&nbsp;
them, finally breaking in. James hands Charlie a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:33.760 --> 00:06:38.000
gun and tells him to hide in the basement. He&nbsp;
forgets to untie the stranger in a hurry and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:38.000 --> 00:06:42.640
gets ready to fight. Zoey hides in her room,&nbsp;
while the stranger tries to free himself. 
&nbsp;

00:06:43.520 --> 00:06:47.680
Now the purgers start to break in. One of&nbsp;
them opens the main door for the leader,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:47.680 --> 00:06:52.720
and he gets in with his gun. As they hide around&nbsp;
the house, one purger gets in through the basement&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:52.720 --> 00:06:57.600
door and attacks Charlie. As he is about to&nbsp;
kill him, James shoots the man from behind.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:57.600 --> 00:07:02.320
The group maniacally roams around the house.&nbsp;
James fights and kills most of them, but the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:02.320 --> 00:07:07.520
leader appears before him and stabs him. As James&nbsp;
lays in the ground dying, the leader politely&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:07.520 --> 00:07:11.520
thanks him and kisses his forehead. The others&nbsp;
start to destroy everything in the house.  
&nbsp;

00:07:12.400 --> 00:07:15.520
Charlie is in the study room,&nbsp;
looking at the surveillance footage,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:15.520 --> 00:07:19.360
when he sees two people approach the&nbsp;
purgers in their front yard and kill them.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:19.360 --> 00:07:24.560
He notices that the people are their neighbours,&nbsp;
Grace and her husband. Slowly, all the neighbors&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:24.560 --> 00:07:29.760
gather to help the Sandins. But at the same&nbsp;
time, Mary is caught by two of the purgers.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:29.760 --> 00:07:34.640
The girl purger tickles Mary as she begs for her&nbsp;
life. Just when she is about to hit Mary with her&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:34.640 --> 00:07:40.320
machete, their neighbor, Mr. and Mrs. Halverson&nbsp;
shoot the two dead. Mary goes to help James.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:40.320 --> 00:07:45.280
But before they can do anything, the leader walks&nbsp;
into the room. He clocks his gun and thanks them&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:45.280 --> 00:07:50.480
for their sacrifice. Zoey suddenly appears and&nbsp;
shoots the man dead before he can kill them.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:50.480 --> 00:07:55.280
The family sits around James, crying as he dies&nbsp;
when the neighbors arrive. Mary thanks them&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:55.280 --> 00:07:59.440
for their help, however, it turns out that the&nbsp;
neighbors want to kill the Sandins themselves.
&nbsp;

00:08:00.160 --> 00:08:04.160
They are jealous of James’s money and want to&nbsp;
purge themselves of the jealousy by killing&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:04.160 --> 00:08:08.720
the family. They then drag James’s body to&nbsp;
the other room and take the others hostage.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:09.280 --> 00:08:13.920
Mary begs them to leave her kids and they tie all&nbsp;
three of them with duct tape. The neighbours then&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:13.920 --> 00:08:18.640
hold each other's hand and thank the new founding&nbsp;
fathers for providing them with this opportunity.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:18.640 --> 00:08:23.200
They have always been jealous of Sandin’s perfect&nbsp;
family, and when the purgers broke into the house&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:23.200 --> 00:08:28.480
today, they saw the opportunity. As they are about&nbsp;
to harm the family, the stranger from earlier&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:28.480 --> 00:08:34.080
saves them. He shoots Mr. Halverson dead and holds&nbsp;
Grace at gunpoint. The neighbors now stand in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:34.080 --> 00:08:39.280
a line in front of them. Grace asks Mary to kill&nbsp;
them and put an end to this; however, Mary has had&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:39.280 --> 00:08:43.760
enough of these killings. She tells everyone to&nbsp;
stay there until seven when the purge stops. 
&nbsp;

00:08:44.480 --> 00:08:48.320
A few minutes later, everyone is sitting&nbsp;
at the dining table together in silence.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:48.880 --> 00:08:51.920
The stranger still points his gun at&nbsp;
the neighbours to keep them in check.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:52.480 --> 00:08:58.080
Charlie and Zoey cry, while holding their father’s&nbsp;
hand. Suddenly, Grace tries to take the rifle from&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:58.080 --> 00:09:03.680
Mary’s hand, but Mary breaks her nose instead,&nbsp;
yelling at her. Finally, the sirens ring,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:03.680 --> 00:09:08.080
indicating that the purge has completed.&nbsp;
Mary tells everyone to get out of her house;&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:08.080 --> 00:09:13.040
the stranger too leaves at the end, after Mary&nbsp;
thanks him for his help. The movie ends as the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:13.040 --> 00:09:17.280
three surviving members of the family look at&nbsp;
several dead bodies lying outside the house.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:17.840 --> 00:09:22.000
A voice in the background narrates that&nbsp;
this was the most successful purge to date.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:22.000 --> 00:09:26.640
Other news reporters claim that the streets of Los&nbsp;
Angeles are filled with dead bodies and the stock&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:26.640 --> 00:09:32.080
market has risen to its highest. In the end, a man&nbsp;
says that he is no longer proud to be American,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:32.080 --> 00:09:36.480
because both of his sons died in the purge.  
That was my recap for the movie ‘The Purge’
